    <summary>Where is my save file?</summary>
    <div class="help-body">
        <p>Planet Crafter save files (<code>save_*.json</code>) live here:</p>
        <ul>
            <li><strong>Windows:</strong> <code>%USERPROFILE%\AppData\LocalLow\MijuGames\Planet Crafter\Saves</code></li>
            <li><strong>Linux (Steam Proton):</strong> <code>~/.steam/steam/steamapps/compatdata/1284190/pfx/drive_c/users/steamuser/AppData/LocalLow/MijuGames/Planet Crafter/Saves</code></li>
            <li><strong>macOS (Steam):</strong> <code>~/Library/Application Support/MijuGames/Planet Crafter/Saves</code></li>
        </ul>
        <p class="help-tip">Tip: copy the file before editing, just in case.</p>
    </div>
</details>
